1
00:00:00,422 --> 00:00:03,922
(Howard:)We'll say it was beautiful
in the comment section.

2
00:00:11,223 --> 00:00:12,953
(Leonard:)No, no, no. Hang on.

3
00:00:13,024 --> 00:00:16,224
(Leonard:)I believe I'm supposed to
carry you across the threshold.

4
00:00:16,294 --> 00:00:18,764
(Penny:)Can you?

5
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:20,530
(Leonard:)Who do you think
carries Sheldon to bed

6
00:00:20,597 --> 00:00:23,067
(Leonard:)when he falls asleep
in front of the TV?

7
00:00:23,133 --> 00:00:24,863
(Penny:)Okay, let's do it.

8
00:00:26,169 --> 00:00:27,869
(sighs)
(grunts)

9
00:00:32,042 --> 00:00:33,812
(grunting softly)

10
00:00:33,877 --> 00:00:36,077
(Penny:)You gonna make it?
I'm okay!

11
00:00:36,146 --> 00:00:37,376
(grunts)

12
00:00:37,448 --> 00:00:38,678
(both chuckle)

13
00:00:38,749 --> 00:00:40,849
Nicely done!

14
00:00:40,917 --> 00:00:42,247
Thank you. (chuckles)

15
00:00:42,319 --> 00:00:43,389
(Leonard:)Finally, there's
a Mrs. Hofstadter

16
00:00:43,453 --> 00:00:45,953
(Leonard:)who isn't disappointed in me.

17
00:00:46,021 --> 00:00:48,021
(Penny:)Well, the night is still young.

18
00:00:48,090 --> 00:01:00,020
(chuckles)

